#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:144
msgid ""
"Please enter authentication information for:\n"
"Workgroup = %1\n"
"Server = %2\n"
"Share = %3"
msgstr ""
"Fermo informationên authentikationê deîne jibo:\n"
"Grupakar = %1\n"
"Server = %2\n"
"Ressource (Share) = %3"

#: kio_smb_auth.cpp:221
msgid ""
"You are missing your $HOME/.smb/smb.conf file, and we could not create it.\n"
"Please manually create it to enable the smb ioslave to operate correctly.\n"
"The smb.conf file could look like: [global]    workgroup= "
"<YOUR_DEFAULT_WORKGROUP>"
msgstr ""
"Ev faîl ji te kême $HOME/.smb/smb.conf, û çê nebû em biaferînin.\n"
"Fermo vê faîlê bi destên xwe damezrîne, jibo ku modul ya SMB-inpuoutput kari be karbike.\n"
"Faîla smb.conf lewaneye wissa be: [global]    workgroup= "
"<GRUPA_KAR_YA_TE_YA_STANDARD>"

